# Application Insights (HTTP) sink — configuration UI placeholder.
# Flat form: every field on its own row, no collapsible sections.
#
# Sink kind: application_insights_http
#
# This is the HTTP-flavoured variant. It POSTs MessageData
# telemetry envelopes directly to Application Insights' ingestion
# endpoint via HttpClient — no Microsoft.ApplicationInsights SDK
# dependency. Narrow dependency graph, AOT-friendly.
#
# Pick this sink if you want minimal dependencies, AOT-clean
# publishing, or you are already using the OTLP HTTP sink and
# prefer the same shape for AI. Pick application_insights_sdk
# instead if you want idiomatic AI telemetry types (TraceTelemetry,
# ExceptionTelemetry) and Serilog drop-in semantics.

